@host = http://localhost:5101

### Create a candidate
POST {{host}}/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}

### List all candidates
GET {{host}}/candidates

### Search candidates by name
GET {{host}}/candidates?search=ada

### Get a candidate by id (replace the id)
GET {{host}}/candidates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update a candidate (replace the id)
PUT {{host}}/candidates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ada King",
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
